DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
22208::$$$message_0174_0000_0000$$$::The sky is clear.[lr]::
22209::$$$message_0174_0000_0001$$$::The strong sunlight numbs my sense of the seasons.[lr]::
22210::$$$message_0174_0000_0002$$$::The sea breeze brushing against my cheeks feels good, and the cries of the black-tailed gulls ease my loneliness.[lr]::
22211::$$$message_0174_0000_0003$$$::[se volume=50 storage=se544.wav]A perfect location that brings no complaints.[lr]::
22212::$$$message_0174_0000_0004$$$::Fuyuki's port would be a breath of fresh air for an old man who enjoys afternoon walks or an athlete training for a marathon. However...::
22213::$$$message_0174_0001_0000$$$::Because of these two polar opposites, there is a hostile atmosphere...![lr]::
22214::$$$message_0174_0001_0001$$$::"There's another person now...!?"[lr]::
22215::$$$message_0174_0001_0002$$$::Behind Lancer...[lr]::
22216::$$$message_0174_0001_0003$$$::That man in brown, with a reliable back that shines, is without a doubt a new person with a lot of free time...![wm canskip=0]::
22217::$$$message_0174_0002_0000$$$::"Heh, the 16th yellowtail caught.[lr]::
22218::$$$message_0174_0002_0001$$$::This is a good fishing port; I can catch fish in an interesting way. By the way, how many have you caught, man behind me?"[lr]::
22219::$$$message_0174_0002_0002$$$::"Shut up, why do I have to answer you? You're loud, do it somewhere else."::
22220::$$$message_0174_0003_0000$$$::"Ha ha ha. You only have eight mackerels so far?[lr]::
22221::$$$message_0174_0003_0001$$$::That must be the most you can do with an outdated fishing style. [wvl][se storage=se608.wav]The 17th fish caaaught!"[cacheimage storage=090_é‡£notice01][wvs][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=45 top=290 time=500 accel=-2 storage=090_é‡£notice01][wm canskip=0]::
22222::$$$message_0174_0004_0000$$$::"Shut up I said, you modern wannabe! The fish's gonna escape!"::
22223::$$$message_0174_0005_0000$$$::"Heh. You've stooped low to blame your lack of ability on others, Lancer. If the nearby fish are running away, you can just switch to reel fishing.[lr]::
22224::$$$message_0174_0005_0001$$$::Most of all, I don't think that a caveman like you can understand anything about reel fishing but[line len=2]oh sorry, 18th caaaught!"::
22225::$$$message_0174_0006_0000$$$::The man in the red jacket cheers.[lr]::
22226::$$$message_0174_0006_0001$$$::[font italic=true]...That's weird.[font italic=false][lr]::
22227::$$$message_0174_0006_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Was seeing adults acting like kids this hard to watch...?[font italic=false]::
22228::$$$message_0174_0007_0000$$$::"...Wait, what is that?"[lr]::
22229::$$$message_0174_0007_0001$$$::...I really want to look away even though it's about myself.[lr]::
22230::$$$message_0174_0007_0002$$$::His pants and jacket are decked out like Gyoshin, and his rod of bad taste is made of high quality 99% carbon, with no expense spared.[lr]::
22231::$$$message_0174_0007_0003$$$::The reel is a crystallization of modern technology, with sixteen precision ball bearings and an electric-powered high-speed reeling system...!::
22232::$$$message_0174_0008_0000$$$::"...Lucky. That's the newest reel model..."[lr]::
22233::$$$message_0174_0008_0001$$$::The man in red's reel is a masterpiece that is equal to or even surpasses Lancer's animal instinct.[lr]::
22234::$$$message_0174_0008_0002$$$::If you input data into it, the reel will do the rest. It's so high-tech that it's hard to tell if he's coming to fish or if he's checking up on the machine's condition.::
22235::$$$message_0174_0009_0000$$$::All the other types of options are cutting-edge, high-end products.[lr]::
22236::$$$message_0174_0009_0001$$$::The price of that equipment sums up to 203,000 yen. Such extravagance.[lr]::
22237::$$$message_0174_0009_0002$$$::By the way, it goes without saying that [font italic=true]all[font italic=false] of them are fakes made from Projection.::
22238::$$$message_0174_0010_0000$$$::"Ha ha ha. At this rate, the match will be settled before dawn! I started with a light warm-up, but it seems there's no need to see how it goes.[lr]::
22239::$$$message_0174_0010_0001$$$::Hey Lancer, it doesn't matter if I catch all the fish at this port, right?"::
22240::$$$message_0174_0011_0000$$$::"Yeah, yeah, go ahead and do it if you can. If you're able to, I'll never call you Archer again."[lr]::
22241::$$$message_0174_0011_0001$$$::"Well said, Lancer.[lr]::
22242::$$$message_0174_0011_0002$$$::Heheh, to think that I would have a showdown with you like this...! Let us make it clear who is the strongest at the fishing harbor!"::
22243::$$$message_0174_0012_0000$$$::To the high-spirited Archer, Lancer says, "I don't care. I wish you would go somewhere else."[lr]::
22244::$$$message_0174_0012_0001$$$::[font italic=true]...See, I told you so.[font italic=false][lr]::
22245::$$$message_0174_0012_0002$$$::Weird things come near you since you say weird things.::
22246::$$$message_0174_0013_0000$$$::I sneakily leave the port, so that I don't interrupt them.[lr]::
22247::$$$message_0174_0013_0001$$$::I pray that Archer's name doesn't change to Angler.tv¾ù